' What a library grid does when a page after its first fails: whether the user is told, and
' when the grid asks for that page again. The items already shown stay. The first page has its
' own failure state instead (BaseGridView.onGridLoadFailed).
'
' In source/ rather than in the view so a Rooibos suite can reach it: a component's functions
' are scoped to it. Same move as gridPage.bs.
namespace gridPaging

  ' The failure notice for a new query: nothing told yet.
  function newFailureNotice() as object
    return { isTold: false }
  end function

  ' A later page failed. Whether to tell the user now, counted as told when so.
  '
  ' Once, until a page loads again: moving near the end of the grid asks again, and each
  ' failed ask must not raise another toast. Never while the grid is not on screen: that is
  ' another screen, and the grid asks again once it is back (shouldResume), where a failure
  ' is told.
  '
  ' @param notice - from newFailureNotice(); modified
  ' @param isShown - whether the grid is the view on screen
  function shouldTellPageFailure(notice as object, isShown as boolean) as boolean
    if not isShown or notice.isTold then return false
    notice.isTold = true
    return true
  end function

  ' A page loaded, so the next failure is news again.
  '
  ' @param notice - from newFailureNotice(); modified
  sub pageLoaded(notice as object)
    notice.isTold = false
  end sub

  ' Whether a grid coming back on screen asks for its next page: its load stopped short and
  ' nothing is loading. Coming back is the user's doing, and it asks once — the same trigger
  ' as moving near the end of the grid, which asks under the same count.
  '
  ' @param loadedItems - items in the grid
  ' @param total - the server's total for the query; 0 until its first page lands
  ' @param isLoading - whether a later page is in flight
  function shouldResume(loadedItems as integer, total as integer, isLoading as boolean) as boolean
    return not isLoading and loadedItems > 0 and loadedItems < total
  end function

end namespace
